# #189 Piece 2 (disc 508 D5(3)) — intent modifier on a local fact is rejected
library "Intent Coverage Cases".
covers "Intent Coverage".

fact "Sample Patient":
- name is "Sample Patient".
- birth date is "1970-01-01".
- defined by "Patient".

fact "Skull Finding":
- date is "2026-01-15".
- defined by "Intent Coverage"."Skull Fracture".

// A ruled-out skull fracture. The author means ABSENT, but membership sees only the
// code → the concept would compute PRESENT. Rejected loud (negation semantics = #257).
case "skull ruled out via absent intent on a local fact -> rejected":
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Skull Finding" with absent intent because `fracture ruled out on imaging`.
- result is "Coverage Determination" is "approve".
